--- Third-party code Tenkai does NOT ship -----------------------------------

These are credited in upstream's current NOTICE and are named here so the
reduction is auditable. No file from them is in this tree (verified by path
search, see docs/ATTRIBUTION.md and docs/BRANDING.md):

  * Nomarchy bar style (Omarchy quattro port, MIT) — no
    barstyles/nomarchy/ directory exists here.
  * Shima bar style, a port of iNiR by snowarch (AGPL-3.0 with additional
    section 7 terms) — no quickshell/inir/ directory exists here.
  * Python bar style, a port of Serpantinum by ilyamiro (AGPL-3.0-or-later) — not
    present.
  * ii dock design (ii-p3drovfx) — not present.
  * Kit's Dev/Commands/Typing/Phone tabs (quickshell/keys/) and the phone module
    — not present.
  * Monkeytype word lists and key sounds — not present.
  * Redux dictation adapter (voxtype-redux-adapter, MIT) and parakeet.cpp — not
    present.
  * Default Vesktop/Equibop theme (ryoku-discord, MIT) — not present.

